Added;

-5 new guns. Now you can spend all those bullets enemies dropped.



Changed;

-4th boss bounce shot replaced with a new mechanic, it should be very obvious what is happening now.

-Fishmen now use actual bullets not a hit-scan weapon. You can reflect his shots.



Fixed;

-Further attempt at fixing the bug where the player would get stuck in corners.

-Further attempt at fixing the teleporting though room transitions (no idea how it still happens I could not reproduce it.)

